ut let me check with another method to confirm. Maybe adding the numbers as whole:\n\n309,546 + 629,237. Let's break them down:\n\n300,000 + 600,000 = 900,000\n\n9,000 + 29,000 = 38,000\n\n500 + 200 = 700\n\n40 + 30 =70\n\n6 +7=13\n\nAdding those together: 900,000 +38,000 is 938,000. Then +700 is 938,700. +70 is 938,770. +13 is 938,783. Okay, that matches. So the answer should be 938,783.\n",
