 yes, that gives 1,405,588. Hmm, but let me add them another way to confirm. Maybe breaking them into parts.\n\nAlternatively, 625,231 + 700,000 is 1,325,231. Then add 80,357. 1,325,231 +80,000 =1,405,231. Then add 357: 1,405,231 +357 =1,405,588. Okay, same result. So that seems right. I think that's correct. So the answer should be 1,405,588.\n",
