e right:\nOnes: 2 + 6 = 8 \u2714\ufe0f\nTens: 8 + 5 = 13, carry 1 \u2714\ufe0f\nHundreds: 6 + 2 + 1 = 9 \u2714\ufe0f\nThousands: 3 + 5 = 8 \u2714\ufe0f\nTen thousands: 8 + 0 = 8 \u2714\ufe0f\nHundred thousands: 7 + 7 = 14, so 4 with a carryover \u2714\ufe0f\nMillions: 1 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nYes, that adds up to 1,485,938. I think that's correct.\n",
