ce was 1, but the ten thousands place addition was 0+0+1 (carryover) =1, so there's no additional carryover from there. So the hundred thousands place is 5+7=12, so that gives 2 in that place and carryover 1 to the millions. So total is 1,215,554. Hmm, maybe my first calculation was right. Let me confirm with another method. \n\nAlternatively, maybe break the numbers into parts. 508,066 is 500,000 + 8,000 + 66. 707,488 is 700,000 + 7,000 + 488. Adding the large parts: 500k +700k =1,200,000. Then 8,000 +7,000=15,000. Then 66 +488=554. Adding all together: 1,200,000 +15,000 is 1,215,000, plus 554 gives 1,215,554. Okay, that matches. So the answer should be correct.\n",
