: 2 + 9 = 11. Write 1, carryover 1.\n\nTens: 3 + 4 = 7 + 1 = 8. Write 8.\n\nHundreds: 9 + 2 = 11. Write 1, carryover 1.\n\nThousands: 7 + 2 = 9 + 1 = 10. Write 0, carryover 1.\n\nTen thousands: 1 + 2 = 3 + 1 = 4. Write 4.\n\nHundred thousands: 3 + 4 = 7. Write 7.\n\nSo the total is 740,181. Yep, that's the same as before. I think that's right. Maybe I can use another method, like adding the numbers in parts. Let's split each number into hundreds, thousands, etc.\n\n317,932 is 300,000 + 17,000 + 900 + 30 + 2.\n\n422,249 is 400,000 + 22,000 + 200 + 40 + 9.\n\nAdding each part:\n\n300k + 400k = 700k.\n\n17k + 22k = 39k.\n\n900 + 200 = 1,100.\n\n30 + 40 = 70.\n\n2 + 9 = 11.\n\nNow add all those together: 700,000 + 39,000 = 739,000. Then +1,100 = 740,100. Then +70 = 740,170. Then +11 = 740,181. Perfect, same result. Okay, definitely confident now. The answer is 740,181.\n",
